  "id": "avoidance-gradient",
  "term": "avoidance gradient",
  "definition": "An avoidance gradient is the pattern in which avoidance behavior becomes stronger as something aversive is approached. In the source, it refers to flight paths showing greater divergence from a turbine’s direction at closer distances, especially when the turbine was operating.",
